  "packages": [
    {
      "name": "widget",
      "summary": "A command wrapper of every shape the tool spec must read: settings on core's base with its inherited setters, a kind-changing setter, a literal union behind a type alias, a rest parameter, an optional one, a union of keywords, a date, a setter of plain data, a setter taking a nested lambda, a union of a host and a string where the string is kept, setters of a callback, a bigint, a signal and a host the spec must leave out, a protected member, and a task object declared through an interface.",
